apprentice-refund = If you cannot reach any of your apprentices today, you can feed the contract back into your spellbook to refund it.

apprentice-destruction-name = Apprentice of Destruction

apprentice-destruction-blurb = Your apprentice is skilled in offensive magic. They know Magic Missile and Fireball.

apprentice-bluespace-name = Student of Translocation

apprentice-bluespace-blurb = Your apprentice is able to defy physics, melting through solid objects and travelling great distances in the blink of an eye. They know Teleport and Ethereal Jaunt.

apprentice-healing-name = Neophyte of Restoration

apprentice-healing-blurb = Your apprentice is training to cast spells that will aid your survival. They know Forcewall and Charge and come with a Staff of Healing.

apprentice-robeless-name = Robeless Pupil

apprentice-robeless-blurb = Your apprentice is training to cast spells without their robes. They know Knock and Mindswap.

