avatarhelp-title = Domain Information

avatarhelp-welcome = Welcome to the Virtual Domain.

avatarhelp-default = No information available! Ask for assistance if needed.

avatarhelp-search-title = Search

avatarhelp-search-text = Study the area and do what needs to be done to recover the crate. Pay close attention to domain information and context clues.

avatarhelp-recover-title = Recover

avatarhelp-recover-text = Bring the crate to the designated sending location in the safehouse. The area may seem out of place. Examine the safehouse to find it.

avatarhelp-disconnect-title = Disconnect

avatarhelp-disconnect-text = The ladder represents the safest way to disconnect before the cache is recovered. Should your connection sever, the netpod offers limited resuscitation potential.

avatarhelp-security-title = Security

avatarhelp-security-text = While connected, you are somewhat safe from environmental hazards and intrusions, but not completely. Pay close attention to alerts.

avatarhelp-attempts-title = Limited Attempts

avatarhelp-attempts-text = Generating avatars costs tremendous bandwidth. Do not waste them.

avatarhelp-danger-title = Realized Danger

avatarhelp-danger-text = Remember that you are physically linked to this presence. You are a foreign body in a hostile environment. It will attempt to forcefully eject you.
